From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mckenna654 <mckenna654@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 19:32:27 +1100
Subject: Add the navigation arrow

An arrow beside the player points along a walkable path to the next story
goal. Goals and per-map routes are generated by tools/gen_nav.py from the
game's map data (doors, map edges, one-way ledges, cuttable trees, boulders
and lifts); on the current map a flood fill from the door, edge or person
finds the path, going around people who stand still and re-routing around
anyone in the way. Stairs and exit mats show which way to push.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>

